<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
<meta charset="UTF-8">
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width,initial-scale=1">
<meta name="theme-color" content="#101c32">
<meta name="description" content="Micdom AI Records — Liberian Kolokwa Drill, original music, virtual artists and Global Footprints LIVE.">
<title>Micdom AI Records | From Monrovia to the World</title>
<link rel="manifest" href="/manifest.json">
<link rel="icon" href="/micdom-logo.png">
<style>
:root{color-scheme:dark;--bg:#101c32;--panel:#192b46;--gold:#e9bd62;--white:#fff;--muted:#d0d9e7;--teal:#54d6c6}
*{box-sizing:border-box}
body{margin:0;background:var(--bg);color:var(--white);font:18px/1.65 Arial,sans-serif}
a{color:var(--teal)}
a:focus,button:focus{outline:3px solid var(--gold);outline-offset:4px}
.skip{position:absolute;left:-9999px}.skip:focus{left:10px;z-index:10;background:#000;padding:12px}
header{text-align:center;padding:24px 15px;background:#0b1425;border-bottom:2px solid var(--gold)}
.logo{width:110px;height:110px;object-fit:contain}
h1,h2{line-height:1.2;color:var(--gold)}
h1{font-size:clamp(2rem,6vw,3.4rem)}
h2{font-size:clamp(1.6rem,4vw,2.2rem)}
nav{display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;justify-content:center;gap:12px;padding:16px;background:#14243b}
nav a{padding:9px 13px;border:1px solid #52647e;border-radius:8px;text-decoration:none}
main{max-width:1050px;margin:auto;padding:20px 15px}
section{margin:22px 0;padding:24px;background:var(--panel);border:1px solid #344862;border-radius:14px}
.hero{text-align:center;padding:40px 20px}
.hero p{max-width:720px;margin:15px auto}
.button{display:inline-block;margin:7px;padding:12px 18px;border-radius:8px;background:var(--gold);color:#101c32;text-decoration:none;font-weight:bold}
.secondary{background:#294663;color:white}
.cards{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(auto-fit,minmax(210px,1fr));gap:14px}
.card{padding:17px;background:#102039;border-radius:10px}
.card h3{color:var(--teal)}
iframe{width:100%;aspect-ratio:16/9;border:0;border-radius:10px}
.dj-buttons{display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:10px}
button{font:inherit;cursor:pointer}
.dj-buttons button{padding:11px;background:#294663;color:white;border:1px solid var(--teal);border-radius:8px}
video{width:100%;max-width:600px;border-radius:10px}
#ownerPanel{display:none;border:2px solid var(--gold);padding:18px;border-radius:10px}
footer{text-align:center;padding:25px;background:#0b1425;color:var(--muted)}
.small{font-size:15px;color:var(--muted)}
@media(prefers-reduced-motion:reduce){html{scroll-behavior:auto}}
</style>
</head>
<body>
<a class="skip" href="#main">Skip to main content</a>
<header>
<img class="logo" src="./micdom-logo.png" alt="Micdom AI Records logo">
<h1>MICDOM AI RECORDS</h1>
<p>Music • Technology • Culture • Global Footprints</p>
<p>Commonwealth of Israel Church · Micdom AI Records Ministry</p>
</header>
<nav aria-label="Main navigation">
<a href="#about">About</a><a href="#music">Music</a><a href="#video">Watch</a>
<a href="#live">Global LIVE</a><a href="./stage.html">Pharaoh Chamber</a>
<a href="./metatron.html">Metatron</a><a href="./roster.json">Artist Roster</a>
</nav>
<main id="main">
<section class="hero">
<h2>From Monrovia to the World</h2>
<p>Welcome to Micdom AI Records: an independent creative platform bringing Liberian sound, original music, AI artist personas and storytelling to a global audience.</p>
<a class="button" href="https://www.tiktok.com/@micdom_ai_records" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Visit Micdom on TikTok</a>
<a class="button secondary" href="#music">Explore the Music</a>
</section>
<section id="about">
<h2>Our House Sound: Kolokwa Drill</h2>
<p>Kolokwa Drill is Micdom AI Records' signature sound: Liberian Hipco and Kolokwa vocals over a swinging, highlife-bouncing trap engine.</p>
<p>Our creative universe brings together rhythm, storytelling, technology and virtual performers.</p>
</section>
<section id="music">
<h2>The Catalog</h2>
<div class="cards">
<article class="card"><h3>Monrovia To Zion</h3><p>A journey of identity, roots and destination.</p></article>
<article class="card"><h3>The Amen</h3><p>A musical expression of faith and affirmation.</p></article>
<article class="card"><h3>Democracy’s Ulogy</h3><p>A creative reflection on democracy and society.</p></article>
</div>
</section>
<section id="video">
<h2>Featured Video</h2>
<iframe src="https://www.youtube-nocookie.com/embed/WIgbyHpIIZ4" title="Micdom AI Records featured video" loading="lazy" allowfullscreen></iframe>
<p><a href="https://youtu.be/WIgbyHpIIZ4" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Watch directly on YouTube</a></p>
</section>
<section id="live">
<h2>Global Footprints LIVE</h2>
<p>A virtual broadcast connecting music, conversation, culture and creative voices across borders.</p>
<a class="button" href="https://www.tiktok.com/@micdom_ai_records" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Visit the TikTok LIVE Community</a>
</section>
<section id="crew">
<h2>The Micdom Creative Universe</h2>
<div class="cards">
<article class="card"><h3>DJ Dehrtay Dog</h3><p>Virtual DJ and broadcast personality.</p></article>
<article class="card"><h3>SoundClash</h3><p>Music and sound energy.</p></article>
<article class="card"><h3>Nefertiti</h3><p>Creative voice and personality.</p></article>
<article class="card"><h3>Hallel</h3><p>Music and ministry expression.</p></article>
<article class="card"><h3>Ivory</h3><p>Micdom creative personality.</p></article>
<article class="card"><h3>Imhotep & Da’at</h3><p>The creative twin personas.</p></article>
<article class="card"><h3>Papay</h3><p>Micdom creative personality.</p></article>
<article class="card"><h3>Metatron</h3><p>Digital production and broadcast interface.</p></article>
</div>
</section>
<section id="chamber">
<h2>Pharaoh Chamber</h2>
<p>Enter the virtual stage and broadcast environment.</p>
<a class="button" href="./stage.html">Enter Pharaoh Chamber</a>
<a class="button secondary" href="./metatron.html">Open Metatron Console</a>
</section>
<section id="dj">
<h2>DJ Dehrtay Dog — Expression Controls</h2>
<p class="small">Choose an expression.</p>
<div class="dj-buttons">
<button data-expression="welcome">Welcome</button><button data-expression="idle">Idle</button>
<button data-expression="neutral">Neutral</button><button data-expression="nodding">Nodding</button>
<button data-expression="shocked">Shocked</button><button data-expression="thinking">Thinking</button>
<button data-expression="breaking">Breaking</button><button data-expression="signoff">Signoff</button>
</div>
<video id="djExpression" controls playsinline preload="none" aria-label="DJ expression video"></video>
</section>
<section>
<h2>Owner Access</h2>
<p class="small">Private interface controls for the site owner.</p>
<div id="ownerPanel">
<h3>Micdom Owner Panel</h3>
<p>Owner interface open on this device.</p>
<a class="button" href="./stage.html">Open Stage</a>
<a class="button secondary" href="./metatron.html">Open Metatron</a>
<button class="button secondary" id="ownerExit">Close Owner Panel</button>
</div>
</section>
</main>
<footer>
<strong>Micdom AI Records</strong>
<p>Creative expression from Liberia to the world.</p>
<p class="small">© <span id="year"></span> Micdom AI Records. All rights reserved.</p>
</footer>
<script>
(()=>{
const panel=document.getElementById('ownerPanel');
const params=new URLSearchParams(location.search);
function showOwner(){panel.style.display='block';localStorage.setItem('micdom_owner','1')}
if(localStorage.getItem('micdom_owner')==='1'||params.has('pharaoh')||location.hash==='#owner')showOwner();
document.getElementById('ownerExit').addEventListener('click',()=>{panel.style.display='none';localStorage.removeItem('micdom_owner')});
let taps=0,timer;
document.querySelector('header').addEventListener('click',()=>{
taps++;clearTimeout(timer);timer=setTimeout(()=>taps=0,2000);
if(taps>=5){showOwner();taps=0}
});
const player=document.getElementById('djExpression');
document.querySelectorAll('[data-expression]').forEach(button=>{
button.addEventListener('click',()=>{
player.src='./dj/expressions-v2/'+button.dataset.expression+'.mp4';
player.load();player.play().catch(()=>{});
});
});
document.getElementById('year').textContent=new Date().getFullYear();
if('serviceWorker'in navigator)addEventListener('load',()=>navigator.serviceWorker.register('/sw.js').catch(()=>{}));
})();
</script>
</body>
</html>
